#: templates/tools.html:88
msgid ""
"Save, watch, and analyze Pokemon Showdown VGC replays locally with PASRS-"
"inspired analysis. Automatic replay saving, a local replay library "
"grouped by team, and deep stats including usage/win rates, lead combos, "
"Tera frequency, move usage, matchup breakdowns, and ELO graphs — all "
"fully private in your browser."
msgstr ""

#: templates/tools.html:89 templates/tools.html:95
msgid "Get Extension"
msgstr ""

#: templates/tools.html:94
msgid ""
"Train smarter for VGC on Pokemon Showdown. Toggleable features that "
"simulate real competitive conditions — hide battle info for hardcore "
"mode, lock in moves with no take-backs, force animations, hide "
"Elo/identities, and pin Open Team Sheets. Build practice habits that "
"translate directly to in-person play."
msgstr ""

